msgstr "Hyfforddiad - Ataliwyd"

#: klines.cpp:226
msgid ""
" The goal of the game is to put\n"
" 5 balls of the same color in line.\n"
msgstr ""
"Amcan y gêm yw rhoi\n"
" 5 pêl o'r un lliw mewn rhes.\n"

#: klines.cpp:235
msgid ""
" You can make horizontal, vertical\n"
" and diagonal lines.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gallwch wneud llinellau llorweddol, \n"
"fertigol a lletraws.\n"

#: klines.cpp:244
msgid "Each turn, three new balls are placed on the board."
msgstr "Mae tair pêl yn cael eu gosod ar y bwrdd bob tro."

#: klines.cpp:252
msgid "Every turn, you can move one ball."
msgstr "Gallwch symud un bêl bob tro."

#: klines.cpp:261
msgid ""
" To move a ball, click on it with the mouse,\n"
" then click where you want the ball to go.\n"
msgstr ""
"I symud pêl, cliciwch arni gyda'r llygoden,\n"
" yna cliciwch lle mae'r bêl i fynd.\n"

#: klines.cpp:276
msgid "You just moved the blue ball!"
msgstr "Rydych newydd symud y bêl las!"

#: klines.cpp:284
msgid ""
" Balls can be moved to every position on the board,\n"
" as long as there are no other balls in their way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gellir symud pêli i unrhyw le ar y bwrdd,\n"
" os nad yw pêli eraill yn eu ffordd.\n"

#: klines.cpp:300
msgid "Now we only need one more blue ball."
msgstr "Mae angen un bêl las arall yn unig rwan."

#: klines.cpp:308
msgid "It seems to be our lucky day!"
msgstr "Dyma ddiwrnod lwcus!"

#: klines.cpp:323
msgid ""
" Hurray! And away they go!\n"
" Now lets try the green balls.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hwre! Ffwrdd a nhw!\n"
" Rwan, gad i ni geisio'r pêli gwyrdd.\n"

#: klines.cpp:344
msgid ""
" Now you try!\n"
" Click on the green ball and move it to the others!\n"
msgstr ""
"Ceisiwch chi rwan!\n"
"  Cliciwch ar y bêl werdd a'i symud at y lleill!\n"

#: klines.cpp:356
msgid "Almost, try again!"
msgstr "Bron, ceisiwch eto!"

#: klines.cpp:361
msgid "Very good!"
msgstr "Da iawn!"

#: klines.cpp:365
msgid "Whenever you complete a line you get an extra turn."
msgstr "Pan gwblhewch linell, byddwch yn cael tro arall."

#: klines.cpp:369
msgid ""
" This is the end of this tutorial.\n"
" Feel free to finish the game!\n"
msgstr ""
"Dyma ddiwedd yr hyfforddiad.\n"
"  Croeso i chi orffen y gêm!\n"

